      "issue": "The global offline banner defined in the design spec is not implemented anywhere, so users never see the message \"You are offline. Some actions require an internet connection.\"",
      "fix": "Create an `OfflineBanner` component that renders a full‑width `Surface` with the specified text using theme colors, and include it at the top of the `Screen` component so it appears on every screen when `NetInfo.isInternetReachable` is false."
    },
    {
      "severity": "low",
      "file": "src/components/ui/PrimaryButton.tsx",
      "issue": "Hard‑coded color values (`#0061A4`, `#FFFFFF`) are used instead of `theme.colors.primary` and `theme.colors.onPrimary`, violating the token usage rule.",
      "fix": "Replace all literal colors with references to the theme (`theme.colors.primary`, `theme.colors.onPrimary`, etc.) via the Paper `theme` prop or a custom style helper."
    },
    {
      "severity": "low",
      "file": "src/components/ui/PrimaryButton.tsx",
      "issue": "Focus-visible state does not show a 2 dp outline using `theme.colors.outline`, making keyboard navigation unclear.",
      "fix": "Add a `style` that applies a border of `2dp` with `borderColor: theme.colors.outline` when the button receives focus (`onFocus`/`onBlur` handling) or use Paper’s `android_ripple` and web `:focus-visible` CSS."
    },
    {
      "severity": "low",
      "file": "src/screens/ReceiptDetailScreen.tsx",
      "issue": "The History icon‑only button has a touch area smaller than 44 × 44 dp, failing the minimum touch‑target requirement.",
      "fix": "Wrap the History icon in a `Pressable` with `hitSlop={{ top: 10, bottom: 10, left: 10, right: 10 }}` or increase the button size to meet the 44 dp requirement, and add a visible label for accessibility."
    },
    {
      "severity": "low",
      "file": "src/components/ui/Screen.tsx",
      "issue": "The screen container applies only `paddingHorizontal: 16` but does not constrain the content width to a max of 420 dp on larger viewports, which can cause horizontal stretch on desktop.",
      "fix": "Add a style rule to the root `View` that sets `maxWidth: 420`, `alignSelf: 'center'`, and applies `marginHorizontal: 'auto'` (or equivalent) so the layout remains phone‑first on desktop."
